mods/herdr-spaces-navigation/main.js started as a copy of the spaces mod that
ships with Herdr (https://herdr.dev), licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(LICENSE-APACHE). That file was changed:
- by herdr-space-folders: folders, folder rules, folder menu and dialog,
  keys that follow the list;
- by herdr-spaces-navigation: tab rows under each space, keys that step
  through tabs, a space menu with colors, more folder colors.

Everything else in this repository is under the MIT License (LICENSE).

The icons the mod draws are Herdr's own (mods/workspace-chrome/), loaded from
the Herdr app at run time. They are not part of this repository.
